Since last ascension I´ve been playing with spellcasters. I got
promising priest, who got killed, because he had a bad dyslexia. I
tried to engrave Elbereth about ten times, without success. Another
promising character died when I hacked spotted jelly and I didn´t
watch my hit points. Then I tried some barbarians and rogues, no
success. Rangers. After a few rangers I got semi-decent one, but there
was Xorn and Master Lich on lvl13. Luckily I didn´t die on THAT level.
Then I thought: "Still one more ranger."

First I went to mines. Minetown had co-aligned temple, a bag of
holding, a magic lamp and only five candles. First wish: blessed +3
gray dragon scale mail. After some sacrifing I got Stormbringer.
Because I had lost way too many promising characters in mines, I
climbed up. I found few bookstores and armour store with helm of
brilliance before oracle. Lvl10 had another co-aligned altar and
stairs leading sokoban.

I did three first levels of sokoban. "AoR. No need of that, yet. Went
mines, got luckstone, came back, got amulet.

Create monster spell was handy. I spend loads of time sacrifing and
praying. I got some spellbooks, a passtune, speed and one protection.
I killed almost every shopkeepers (no, I didn´t kill Izchak), and
bought some more protection.

Quest was a piece of cake. After quest I blessed and enchanted my +0
arrows. 400 hundred blessed +7 arrows. Of course I could have had even
more of them, but 400 was more than enough. In castle I had some fun.
I killed almost everything with porticullis. WoW was (0:1). I already
had [GDSM, [GoP, [SoR and [SP. I wished for uncursed magic marker and
enchanted and fooproofed my stuff. I did Gehennom until Orcus town. No
extra candles. Climbed up again to lvl10, bought some more protection.
In the castle I wished for 7 blessed wax candles, blessed ring of free
action and 2 another uncursed magic markers. Enchanted my armour some
more.

The rest was easy. Vlad is the wimp and Stormbringer worked nicely
against Rodney. I did invocation ritual and went down. After while
Yeenoghu appeared. I killed Yeenoghu and looked what it left behind.
The amulet of Yendor! What the... I identified it. Seemed to be real
one. I tried to put it in BoH. It really is the real one. Then I
started to climb up. She never met the high priest of Moloch.

Mysterious force wasn´t bad, just little annoying. In Medusa level I
did my ONLY stupid move in whole game. I had forgot to grease my BoH,
and I accidently stepped in water. I lost 12 blessed diluted !PoFH and
my only ?SoC. When I went to planes I had only one !PoFH. Earth was
easy, air was bit trickier and fire was easy too. On plane of water I
still had one b?SoG, so I genocided all ;.

Astral. Pestilence on left, Famine on center and Death on right. I got
guardian angel. I headed to center. I zapped Famine with wand of death
and tried to teleport the corpse. Famine revived. This time I killed
it with Stormbringer. Lawful altar. The I headed to left. Pestilence
avoided me. Chaotic altar! But I didn´t want to go alone and my
guardian angel was still alive. I hadn´t found magic whistle so I had
to go help my angel. After while I was standing the altar of Mars with
my angel and sacrificed the amulet.

